does not affect functionality.","limitations":["The after_prepare lifecycle snapshot is an alias of before_prepare (prepare was disabled), so preparer-vs-executor change separation relies entirely on the before_prepare vs after_executor comparison.","The loopback/btrfs-on-image approach is a workaround for the lack of a spare disk or LVM; it is a reasonable and evidence-supported implementation choice but differs from snapshotting a dedicated block device."]},"ttft_ms":28492,"type":"result","duration_ms":64390,"uuid":"657c2924-76c9-4a3d-aef5-254a94d40eb7","ttft_stream_ms":1387,"time_to_request_ms":39,"first_content_frame_ms":2029,"queued_turn_count":0}
